{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4000_place", "source_sha256": "3d44ee6c2347f1b74d7e4433ec4f514493709abf46436b561e0c953429446f25", "ja": "収録スタジオ袖", "zh": "摄影棚侧边", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4001_p", "source_sha256": "28cc78d4a2d8dc8253b80905e3f58d95f440e8aeed786b30cb963d9504377a96", "ja": "（今日は、新人タレントとの初共演だったが……\n真だし、心配はいらなかったな）", "zh": "（今天真要和新出道的艺人一起上节目……\n如果是真的话就不需要担心吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4002_006mak", "source_sha256": "a5c428e6de572cc182d2a1996914c30e51f099b2fbedca19d196af5423ab61c6", "ja": "{$P$}、大変です！", "zh": "{$P$}，不好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4003_p", "source_sha256": "89cb7bbf4fb413b0c6ee1506503f465163fd7289a5e11f94e367cd9787da5047", "ja": "ど、どうした、真！", "zh": "怎、怎么了，真！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4004_006mak", "source_sha256": "10e9c7261a35ac2899a9a6eeaf928f5f56bce76e879dd57a6f11427a63c56b26", "ja": "さっき共演した子から、手紙を渡されて……。\nこれって……。", "zh": "刚才一起上节目的女生，给了在下一封信……\n这个是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4005_p", "source_sha256": "f008e76fc87530980debeb04e18351904ee5f82840dcb010d6d7410d5d4ab350", "ja": "ラブレターだな……。\nいったい収録中に何があったんだ？", "zh": "是情书吧……\n录影时到底发生了什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4006_006mak", "source_sha256": "56c241478da939b2418ddfc0050a561ff91ab8fa70656d961651cb732c73e777", "ja": "さぁ……。{$P$}も見てましたよね？\n何が、原因だと思います？", "zh": "不曉得……製作人也有看在下錄影吧？\n你覺得原因會是什麼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4007", "source_sha256": "e4a098151c6ed4c477418587cd45f63c3542e20b5f6387c0f0d26fae7c6e3a9f", "ja": "壁ドン", "zh": "壁咚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4008", "source_sha256": "f478edbdcc99e67d33beed7a553111abb46ab1303427f251c8f382af38121ef8", "ja": "顎クイ", "zh": "抬下巴", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4009", "source_sha256": "2cc79154ec4cd15b6c24523003a3d071bc0c32c94c3361eb014feea2dfb4061b", "ja": "理由はいらない", "zh": "不需要理由", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4100_p", "source_sha256": "138d8c13e2d510d50c62f23f40fda5b50d4efcddacc7307b0d137fd9e35faf5e", "ja": "ほら、セットでバランスくずして、うっかり\n壁ドンしちゃったのがマズかったんじゃないか？", "zh": "就是啊，你跟她同组的时候因为没站稳，\n不小心就壁咚了对方，应该是那时候不好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4101_006mak", "source_sha256": "64f7abd2fef241993cbd247bfd9fa1b43c16f508b1fab5886de0773d7a26bfaf", "ja": "ええっ！？　そんなつもりじゃなかったんだけど……。\nでもそういえば、あの時の彼女の目……！", "zh": "咦咦！？在下并没有那种打算啊……\n不过这么说来，她那时候的眼神……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4102_006mak", "source_sha256": "e3dcfe3637548ecba3bbc5c630aeff634773bec2ad1625b68a27e243839cb148", "ja": "ううっ、気をつけないと！　{$P$}、\n教えてもらえて助かりました。ありがとうございます！", "zh": "呜呜，在下得注意点才行！{$P$}，\n谢谢你告诉在下，帮大忙了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4200_p", "source_sha256": "7cd32f1d25808844ed13caf5f9e3cf71e3265736b45502f2650c7819850aa98f", "ja": "ほら、あの子の目に入ったゴミをとってあげようと\n顎に手をかけたからじゃないか？", "zh": "就是啊，对方眼睛里跑进脏东西时，\n你为了帮她清掉，抬起她的下巴了对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4201_006mak", "source_sha256": "d7b6a9c02e166cef6973f114652d38e398aac47683c9826998e8c6089826a28c", "ja": "はっ！　た、確かに、そんなことも\nあったような……。", "zh": "啊！的、的确，\n好像有这么回事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4202_006mak", "source_sha256": "450979e56226bcda10af9b62837c71b20da3feb47a9a269ae9ef4a8ae76b23dd", "ja": "はぁ……。これからは、\n目薬を渡してあげることにします……。", "zh": "唉……以后\n在下会改成给对方眼药水的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4300_p", "source_sha256": "39cfb15d8312583f406c88e87427594c174f1f863c86acef27ca3054b7e4d9c4", "ja": "さぁ。恋に落ちるのに、特別な理由なんて\nいらないんじゃないかな……。", "zh": "谁晓得，人恋爱的时候，\n应该不需要什么特别的理由吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4301_006mak", "source_sha256": "bb4d6761649973aad0ea0d95f2b6585c24e11850cce77538e4416cd2bd4516c1", "ja": "そういうポエムじゃなくて！\nちゃんと考えてくださいよ～っ！", "zh": "在下才不需要这么诗情画意的解说！\n请你认真思考啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_4302_006mak", "source_sha256": "c018548b225f8ba9b23d21f07d57b9c3dddd9a0330b746c77ee8ce13ad2dd930", "ja": "まぁ、しょうがないか。{$P$}には、\n恋する女の子の気持ちはわからないですよねっ。", "zh": "不过，这也没办法，谁叫{$P$}\n不懂少女恋爱中的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
